<section class="landing">
<img src="images/bg1.webp" alt="">
<div class="landingDetails">
<h2>Welcome to </h2>
<h1>My Zambia</h1>
<p>Discover the hidden gems and breathtaking chill spots that make Zambia a unique destination. From serene natural wonders to vibrant cultural landmarks, My Zambia is your ultimate guide to exploring the beauty and adventure that this amazing country has to offer.</p>
<img src="images/logo.png" alt="">
</div>
</section>

<section class="destination">
  <h1 data-aos="fade-down" data-aos-delay="300">Destination Highlights</h1>

  <div class="destCard" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="400">
    <div class="innerCard">
      <img src="images/highlights/1.jpg" alt="">s
      <h1>Jackie O</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="destOverlap">
      <h1>Jackie O</h1>
      <p>Jackie O Restaurant is a stylish dining spot known for its elegant ambiance and gourmet menu. With a focus on fresh, locally sourced ingredients, it offers a unique fusion of international and regional flavors, making it a perfect choice for special occasions or a refined night out.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="destCard" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="400">
    <div class="innerCard">
      <img src="images/highlights/2.jpg" alt="">s
      <h1>Club Social</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="destOverlap">
      <h1>Club Social</h1>
      <p>Club Social is a trendy venue known for its vibrant atmosphere and chic design. It offers a lively space for socializing, with a menu that features creative cocktails and modern dishes, making it a popular spot for a night out with friends.</p></div>
  </div>

<div class="destCard" data-aos="fade-down" data-aos-delay="400">
  <div class="innerCard">
    <img src="images/highlights/3.jpg" alt="">
    <h1>Harry's Grill</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="destOverlap">
    <h1>Harry's Grill</h1>
    <p>Harry's Grill is a cozy eatery renowned for its classic, hearty dishes and relaxed atmosphere. It’s a go-to spot for comfort food, offering a menu filled with expertly grilled meats and homestyle favorites, perfect for a laid-back meal.</p></div>
</div>

<div class="destCard" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-delay="400">
<div class="innerCard">
  <img src="images/highlights/4.jpg" alt="">s
  <h1>Urban Yard</h1>
</div>
<div class="destOverlap">
  <h1>Urban Yard</h1>
  <p>Urban Yard is a modern hangout spot known for its urban-chic vibe and innovative menu. With a focus on fresh, creative dishes and craft beverages, it’s an ideal place for those looking to enjoy a stylish, laid-back dining experience.</p></div>
</div>

<div class="destCard" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-delay="400">
<div class="innerCard">
  <img src="images/highlights/5sub.jpg" alt="">s
  <h1>Gigibonta</h1>
</div>
<div class="destOverlap">
  <h1>Gigibonta</h1>
  <p>GigiBontà is a charming spot celebrated for its delightful selection of artisanal gelato and pastries. With a cozy, inviting atmosphere, it’s the perfect place to indulge in sweet treats and enjoy a relaxing break.</p></div>
</div>

<div class="destCard" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="400">
<div class="innerCard">
  <img src="images/highlights/6.jpg" alt="">s
  <h1>Radison Blu</h1>
</div>
<div class="destOverlap">
  <h1>Radison Blu</h1>
 <p>Radisson Blu is a sophisticated hotel offering upscale accommodations and top-notch amenities. Known for its modern design and exceptional service, it provides a luxurious retreat with a range of dining options, a well-equipped fitness center, and elegant event spaces.</p></div>
</div>

<div class="destCard" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="400">
<div class="innerCard">
  <img src="images/highlights/7.jpg" alt="">s
  <h1>Grandaddys's</h1>
</div>
<div class="destOverlap">
  <h1>Grandaddys's</h1>
  <p>Granddaddy's is a lively club renowned for its energetic atmosphere and vibrant nightlife. With a dynamic mix of music, cocktails, and a stylish setting, it’s a go-to destination for an unforgettable night out.</p></div>
</div>

<div class="destCard" data-aos="fade-down" data-aos-delay="400">
<div class="innerCard">
  <img src="images/highlights/8.jpg" alt="">s
  <h1>37D Gallery</h1>
</div>
<div class="destOverlap">
  <h1>37D Gallery</h1>
  <p>37D Gallery is a contemporary art space celebrated for its eclectic exhibitions and immersive cultural experiences. With a focus on innovative works and emerging artists, it offers a dynamic environment for art enthusiasts to explore and engage with modern creativity.</p></div>
</div>

<div class="destCard" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-delay="400">
<div class="innerCard">
  <img src="images/highlights/9.jpg" alt="">s
  <h1>Kalimba Reptile Farm</h1>
</div>
<div class="destOverlap">
  <h1>37D Gallery</h1>
  <p>Kalimba Reptile Farm is an engaging attraction known for its diverse collection of reptiles and amphibians. Visitors can explore and learn about a variety of species in a family-friendly environment, making it a fascinating destination for wildlife enthusiasts and curious minds alike.</p></div>
</div>

<div class="destCard" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-delay="400">
<div class="innerCard">
  <img src="images/highlights/10.jpg" alt="">s
  <h1>Sunday Craft Market</h1>
</div>
<div class="destOverlap">
  <h1>Sunday Craft Market</h1>
  <p>Sunday Craft Market is a vibrant bazaar featuring a wide array of handmade crafts, unique goods, and local artisanal products. With its lively atmosphere and diverse stalls, it offers a charming shopping experience where visitors can discover one-of-a-kind items and support local creators.</p></div>
</div>

